# panel fixture: the LEN knob stops at the shortest step, 1/192, and at the natural maximum, 192/192
# manual: p015, p016
# workflow: Step zoom, step attributes
# p016: "The minimum step length is 1/192." "The natural maximum length of a step is one full note - 192/192."
# A decrement beyond the minimum is legato (p016): that is pending, Q40.
given step 3 5 len = 2
at 0 ms press mode.step
at 200 ms click step(3,5)
at 400 ms release mode.step
at 1000 ms turn edit.enc.len -1
expect engine step 3 5 len = 1
given step 3 5 len = 191
at 1500 ms turn edit.enc.len 5
expect engine step 3 5 len = 192
